{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"*Fabertell returns with a stack of wool blanket/bedrolls with ample rope for binding. They illustrate a visual note of offering to* <@!260820438026813440> <@!692746345387130900> <@!297577343554158603> @♪ 🍞 <@!363458590461132800> *They place the stack under an awning where multiple roofs meet to make certain they stay dry then settle in for another nap*","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:21:58.722000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735275410929221642","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"Grimlock scampers across the roofs, notices Fabertell setting up the supplies under an awning, and makes a bed among them. She settles down for a nap.","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:23:26.115000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735275777481769021","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"Skitter returns to Fabertell and Grimlock nodded off in the afternoon light. It pleased him to see others finding this place as safe and comfortable as he found it. Letting out a contented sigh, he perches on a ledge, overlooking the streets of London.","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:27:28.002000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735276792029642783","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"Fabertell rouses awake, “oh, good morrow. Has your day been full?”","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:35:29.450000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735278811368652921","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"He turns at the voice with a smile \"youre awake! Thanks for the blankets, I've never owned me own before!\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:40:53.280000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735280169610248232","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"He moves to sit by the older being.","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:41:45.968000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735280390599737344","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"I love blankets. Blankets and food will keep me comfortable almost anywhere.\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:42:10.203000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735280492248563733","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"Why are ya bein so nice t us?\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:42:47.843000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735280650122428558","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"Most people with coin don't look twice at the likes o me.\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:43:12.142000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735280752039821433","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"I'm being nice to myself. You can not be kind to yourself without being kind to others.\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:44:43.694000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735281136036741161","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"I suppose it isn't my coin. I didnt make it.\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:45:10.650000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735281249098268676","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"But ya earned it fair and square.\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:45:43.737000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735281387875336203","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"Coin is for giving. The intention behind the giving of it can be many things and only some of them will make the giving worth it.\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:45:57.768000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-21T23:46:02.283000Z","id":"735281446725353621","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"But was it earned by those who gave it to me fair and square?\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:46:22.951000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735281552350642309","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"All coin has touched harm and kindness. To use it affirms both. When I spend it I contribute to my purpose but can not divorce it from every purpose that came before.\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:47:48.122000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735281909583577174","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"Youre real smart.\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:48:23.915000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735282059710431243","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"You talk to me like I'm smart too. Thanks\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:48:51.257000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735282174391091220","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"That is easier to collect than coin. Wisdom is gathered, not crafted.\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:49:05.853000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735282235611021383","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"If you stop gathering it from others it grows old and stale. You have to nurture it like a tree.\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:49:51.180000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735282425726500944","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"( :p )","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:50:17.665000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735282536812511283","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"How do you get wiser?\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:50:56.778000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735282700864454698","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"Through thought and memory. That is what I am collecting in my scrivings. Never pass up the chance to gather it. People will more freely offer it than perhaps any other thing. Even if they try to conceal and withhold it that itself offers up the very thing.\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:52:58.236000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735283210296229949","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"Would you teach me to draw like you?\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:53:17.566000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735283291371995146","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"Also, like the tree, it will grow. How it grows is what you choose.\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:53:27.914000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735283334774521938","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"No, but if you teach me to draw like me I will gladly teach you to draw like you.\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:54:00.822000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735283472800677978","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"734315500091342899","content":"\"I will show you my process and you can keep what is useful.\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T23:54:25.093000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735283574600761405","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
